@FixIt_HostAddress = https://localhost:7072

### 1️⃣ Tüm requestleri listele
GET {{FixIt_HostAddress}}/api/Requests
Accept: application/json

### 2️⃣ Yeni request oluştur
POST {{FixIt_HostAddress}}/api/Requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Laptop ekranı kırıldı, tamir gerekiyor",
  "customerName": "Selin",
  "status": 0
}

### 3️⃣ Request kabul et
POST {{FixIt_HostAddress}}/api/Requests/1/accept
